<title>GERMANY: Moebel Walther raises 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Moebel Walther raises 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>GRUENDAU, Germany 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend per ordinary share		 1.60 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Dividend per preference share	     1.70 vs 1.60</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Moebel Walther AG, a furniture retailer. The dividend will be paid on the first working day after the group's annual general meeting on July 24.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
